Output docs/demo/app.gif
Output docs/demo/app.txt

Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "cd /demo && export PS1='$ ' && clear && phada"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "4"
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "n"
Sleep 1s
Type "saulosw/phada-demo#1"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Wait+Screen@60s /Done in/
Sleep 4s
